′}(x)$, the derivative of a continuous function $y = f(x)$, is given above. Which of the following could be the graph of $y = f(x)$?"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101445 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100936 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "07cdfef0-85d9-5197-b2f2-2f9052d83a3b" :knowledge-point/title "Sketching a Continuous Function Given its Derivative in Algebraic Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "82ae8a1f-7dd0-5150-8920-a28e6297e634" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f4/f46e345eb290a9225411babcb08ebc3ad24083c54c92eb81c7e77271e3fc19d1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099832} {:answer/id #uuid "9c8de85c-3369-5866-99fd-3ed2137b5dae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/3f/3f3920952d7961cede9e3c0da4c2cb41d31bcdd82942e66286b2d2409baaa750.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099833} {:answer/id #uuid "564c7134-e7be-5de4-b0bb-eda0fd78c198" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/59/59b3496a7e4583ca9af9318a6363578fc755fe6e89604a14ad46eb565f9a1468.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099834} {:answer/id #uuid "620a4bb4-30cf-50ba-901b-a34b6f31b8d2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/86/86959eec84fd8a9e02d6ce5c0715fb7c4a43621692b1a4058af75341eb00c6e7.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099835} {:answer/id #uuid "625f7386-2031-5cbb-96dd-bcaf1a7d45d9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e0/e0cd3e8e31f46fffc3b9e7060c5f1d0c9e637fd86a097093caa3f64f26edeff6.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099836}] :answer-field/id #uuid "28df9e23-f800-52c9-9c9c-1069ec9448fe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099831}] :question/id #uuid "e0894de1-f2ec-5434-b75f-84e94baff54e" :question/math-academy-id "q-49036" :question/problem "If $f^{′}(x) =-\\mid x + 2 \\mid$, which of the following could be the graph of a continuous function $y = f(x)$?"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101479 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100830 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "bfa3432b-2bf3-51c8-befb-0299783e7111" :knowledge-point/title "Sketching a Continuous Function Given the Graph of its Non-Smooth Derivative"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bbe47f53-5582-51da-883d-303611b6a979" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f0/f042b8e120a91b914c7328ff0353ee5f7aabb33e131d2f3da1e5415e3438f8b6.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186100036} {:answer/id #uuid "d9fcc64e-794e-5cc1-aed5-874d5c44bdb7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/38/384294a05bc6580a9b1a963d164e538a20930a94a0855d82e48628b7e1805ebb.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186100037} {:answer/id #uuid "e7901d6e-90b0-533a-b924-563b619bc7a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/09/0954153f8aab1b5e08fe1ed4c41ae06331bedc3069b8c8cee0afcb2aae5461bc.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186100038} {:answer/id #uuid "09132355-f0d3-5ab2-a60a-009b69e17e98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f8/f8537359156c71c484801edee852476f0a67a67d84872d3e3d77fd0c2526761d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186100039} {:answer/id #uuid "3549dac9-6168-561f-967d-c8c6f0ff3ecf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/40/408847a845176f67203c35d87932171b2f35150d07403eea22f300087669d31e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186100040}] :answer-field/id #uuid "a19851d6-574f-5fd8-aa19-b650471cb457" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186100035}] 